Toolbox icon: C. Back to [all categories](README.md).

## Blocks

| Block | Friendly label | C++ form | Help | Fields | Inputs |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| \`control.pick\` (statement) | \`if %COND then %DO else if … else %ELSE\` | \`if (%COND) { … }\` | Help for control.pick. | — | \`COND0\`, \`COND1\`, …: a condition, 1 more than \`elseIfCount\`; default \`true\`. \`DO0\`, \`DO1\`, …: blocks, 1 more than \`elseIfCount\`. \`ELSE\`: blocks, while \`hasElse\` is on. Setting \`elseIfCount\`: 0 to 32, default 0. Setting \`hasElse\`: on or off, default off. |

## In the toolbox

1. \`control.pick\`
2. \`control.pick\`, labelled “if … else”, with \`hasElse\` on and \`elseIfCount\` set to \`2\`
